Package: FBPoints
Type: Package
Title: Fantasy Baseball Points Projector 
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kyle Johnstone
Description: The premise of this package is to offer a simple mechanism for 
  calculating a Major League Baseball player's projected fantasy points for the 
  season. The package pulls player data from the razzball website and uses 
  ESPN's fantasy baseball rules to calculate points. The purpose of the package 
  is to gauge players' point potential for baseball fantasy leagues. 
